# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar Belakang {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accurately calculating chemical reaction energies is crucial for scientific advancements in materials science, chemical engineering, drug discovery, and other fields. Among various chemical systems, the Li-S system has garnered significant interest for understanding and developing new battery compositions. This tutorial provides hands-on experience in calculating the Li-S bond dissociation potential energy surface (PES) of a $Li_2S$ system by removing one lithium atom using HiVQE calculations. The results can be compared with reference calculations (CASCI) as well as classical methods like Hartree-Fock (HF) for a 20-qubit problem.\n"
msgstr "Mengira tenaga tindak balas kimia dengan tepat adalah penting untuk kemajuan saintifik dalam sains bahan, kejuruteraan kimia, penemuan ubat, dan bidang-bidang lain. Dalam pelbagai sistem kimia, sistem Li-S telah mendapat perhatian besar untuk memahami dan membangunkan komposisi bateri baharu. Tutorial ini memberikan pengalaman praktikal dalam mengira permukaan tenaga potensi (PES) penceraian ikatan Li-S bagi sistem $Li_2S$ dengan mengeluarkan satu atom litium menggunakan pengiraan HiVQE. Keputusan boleh dibandingkan dengan pengiraan rujukan (CASCI) serta kaedah klasik seperti Hartree-Fock (HF) untuk masalah 20-qubit.\n"

